                "description": "The Lake 1 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Brass Wrap Around Mounts is available with your choice of wood grip. Choose from light or dark wood, all of them unstained so that the natural beauty can shine through. This Lake Door Pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths.",
